1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Every Moon and Mars mission is rehearsed on Earth first.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
But which place on Earth is really the closest?

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
EGIZ compares 4,544 measured Earth windows with 10 targets.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Eight measured dimensions, each with an uncertainty interval.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
It also shows what no Earth site can match: Earth's gravity is 2.6× Mars's.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
In Kazakhstan, Mangystau ranks in Earth's top 1 % for Jezero.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Against bare desert alone the match is weaker — so these are leads to test in the field.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
NASA and ESA data, open code. EGIZ — Astana.
